# Dev Brain Environment Variables

# Local-first LLM — llama.cpp (llama-server, OpenAI-compatible /v1).
# NOT Ollama. Ollama is not installed on this host; nothing listens on :11434.
# The /v1/chat/completions call below also sends `chat_template_kwargs`, which is
# a llama.cpp construct (Ollama uses `options` and rejects it), so this was
# always the llama.cpp wire format — only the default address and model name were
# Ollama's, which made every local call fail and cascade to Gemini silently.
#
# The model id is the GGUF's full path: llama.cpp reports that as its id and
# expects it back verbatim. Shortening it produces a 404 from llama-server.
#
# Discovered lanes are in INFRASTRUCTURE/model-router/litellm.yaml (aliases
# `phi4-mini`, `local-llama`, `local-llama-fast`, `qwen3.5-2b`, plus `local-embed`
# for the nomic-embed lane on :8092).
LOCAL_LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8091
LOCAL_LLM_MODEL=C:\Users\User\Downloads\BUSINESS\INFRASTRUCTURE\model-router\models\Phi-4-mini-instruct.Q8_0.gguf
# Optional: a shorter alias if llama-server is (re)started with --alias.
# LOCAL_LLM_MODEL=phi4-mini
LLAMA_CPP_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8091
# Set to 1 to force the old Gemini-only behaviour.
# DISABLE_LOCAL_LLM=0
LOCAL_LLM_TIMEOUT_MS=300000

# Cloud fallback (optional; used only when the local server is unavailable
# or returns unusable output).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.7-flash

# Jev (System One) decision engine — calibrated choice/noul/score over a state.
# Two-tier chain: tier 1 = Vercel AI Gateway TypeSafe lane (TYPESAFE_BASE_URL +
# a key), tier 2 = LocalJev on :8080 (JEV_LOCAL_BASE_URL, no key). Gateway first
# when a key is configured; any gateway failure falls back to localjev. Both down
# => source:'offline'. The deterministic matrix stays authoritative; Jev adds an
# advisory ranking (POST /api/decide/jev, GET /api/jev/status).
# TYPESAFE_BASE_URL=https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/typesafe
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
# TYPESAFE_MODEL=typesafe-ai/jev
# JEV_LOCAL_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080
# JEV_LOCAL_MODEL=jev-latest
# DEV_BRAIN_JEV_ENABLED=1
# JEV_TIMEOUT_MS=10000
